* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* HRDATFOR
* HELP ROUTINE FOR DATE FORMAT
* FHI    00-01-28 S(191368) MODULE TAKEN FROM NOM142 AND STOWED FOR NOM211
*****
DEFINE DATA
GLOBAL USING NRM-GL
PARAMETER
1 #CODE(A1)
END-DEFINE
INPUT USING MAP 'HMDATFO&'
IF NOT(#CODE = 'A' OR = 'E' OR = 'I' OR = 'G' OR = ' '
            OR = 'B' OR = 'F' OR = 'J' OR = 'H')
   REINPUT *0007 ALARM
END-IF
MOVE TRUE TO G-MAP-MODIFIED
END
